2. In #csv_split changed the value of old_result to simply self.  It was an aesthetics thing, even though it might have been marginally quicker leaving it as it was.
3. Changed #csv_split again to accommodate the edge case where the line has nothing but commas until the last column.  The scans for quotes would fail under such circumstances as it was.


